1 F
1.66 (Programmers should resist the temptation to de\336ne functions within class de\336nitions. De\336ning) 111.6 580.33 P
0.5 (them outside separates the declaration from the implementation details. It allows for the creation) 111.6 568.33 P
0.31 (of separate \336les of inline function de\336nitions. And it facilitates approaches to global \322uninlining\323 of) 111.6 556.33 P
0.78 (functions for debugging. It also minimizes the temptation to inline functions which should not be) 111.6 544.33 P
(inline, such as constructors, destructors, and virtual functions.) 111.6 532.33 T
